%% Request flow for the "streaming, upstream sends keep-alives" scenario.
sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant P as public-api
    participant E as edge-proxy (provider's gateway)
    participant U as upstream-agent

    B->>P: POST /jobs {mode: "streaming_keepalive"}
    P-->>B: 202 Accepted {job_id, events_url}
    B->>P: GET /jobs/{id}/events (EventSource)
    P->>E: POST /v1/runs {response_mode: "streaming"}
    E->>U: (proxied)
    U-->>P: event: run_started / step_started
    loop while the agent is busy
        U-->>P: : ping (sent by the upstream, resets the gateway's idle timer)
    end
    U-->>P: event: run_finished {result}
    P-->>B: timeline events and the final result
    P->>P: POST callback_url {job_id, status, result}
